type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からどんどんひめたんのこと知ってくれたら嬉しいです∩^ω^∩★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/27/4519474/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会楽しそうじゃけど、めっちゃ緊張しそう(汗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやって緊張をほぐしてくれる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと握手してたら緊張なんてどっか行っちゃうと思う..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって緊張させる暇を与えないもんっ(^ω^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/27/4519474/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のミニ握ではネタにこまったけど次ひめたんと握手する時は何て言ったら良いんやろ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に困ったらひめかサンプラー使ったらいいと思うし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介をしてもらっても、ひめたんが自己紹介するのもいいと思う★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん京都のファミレスに傘忘れてきたんよね('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし見つけたら教えてね♪わらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}